- app/khoi_phuc_phien.py (moi): tim_module_trinh_duyet,
  lay_trinh_duyet_cho_tai_khoan (ho_so -> tai dung; email -> tao workspace
  moi), dong_workspace_moi (chi dong workspace do luot nay tao, chi o
  trang thai cuoi, khong dong khi can_nguoi, khong bao gio dong workspace
  san co).
- 4 module *-web: dang_nhap(..., trinh_duyet=None); tham so tuong minh
  thang factory/hook; grok-web + claude-web bo doc hook truc tiep (cho S1).
- app/tuyen.py (batch truc_tiep + tai khoan da luu), app/cong_mcp_cong_cu.py
  (MCP), app/kho_tai_khoan.py + app/tu_lam_moi.py (NV144): loi CAP
  controller khi co, khong bao gio chan loi goi khi khong co (module tu
  quyet co can trinh duyet khong); dong()/dong workspace o finally.
- test/test_nv309_a.py (moi, 11 test) + kiem toan NV45 cho 4 diem
  td.dong() best-effort.
